  nonce: '11e4'  # 11e4
  message: "Fixed in PR #3058 (merged to dev at 1850f635d). Added JS_KNOWN_GLOBALS frozenset in js_ts.py mirroring javascript.yaml globals (console, localStorage, sessionStorage, document, navigator, window, Deno). Extends the WI-banaf/WI-vurop unresolved-call fallback to the no-import case — bare 'Object.method()' on globals now emits calls→{lang}:{obj}:0-0:{method}:unresolved edges for the io-boundaries layer to tag. Shadowing by named_imports, namespace_imports, or typed var_types preserved. 4 regression tests added (main, 2 import-shadowing, 1 typed-parameter shadowing). Full js_ts suite: 329 passed. Smart-test: 2428 passed, 100% coverage."  # 11e4
